---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | Party Alley" description="Get to know Party Alley, an event production and management team for corporate functions and personal celebrations.">
	<section class="bg-white px-5 py-16 text-stone-900 sm:px-6 md:py-24">
		<h1 class="text-center text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">About Us</h1>
		<div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-left leading-relaxed text-stone-600">
			<p>At Party Alley, we specialize in full-service event production and management for corporate functions and personal milestones. We offer event planning and management, event styling and decoration, catering and food services, and event production and equipment. Our goal is to deliver high-quality service at a price that fits your budget.</p>
			<p>Our thoughtfully crafted packages are designed to provide great value, ensuring you get the most out of every service without compromising on quality.</p>
			<p>We understand that every celebration is unique and meaningful. It’s a privilege to be part of your once-in-a-lifetime moments.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
